    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Oil-Based vs. Water-Based Exterior Fence Stain: Engineering Breakdown",
    "description": "Comparative analysis of penetrating alkyd/paraffinic oils versus film-forming acrylic waterborne stains for outdoor privacy fences.",
